Package: pmBART
Type: Package
Title: Probit Monotone BART for Binary Outcomes
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Jared", "Fisher",
      email = "fisher@stat.byu.edu",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Fits Bayesian additive regression tree models for binary outcomes
    using a probit link. The regression surface is constrained to be
    non-decreasing in every predictor. The package provides posterior draws and
    posterior mean probabilities for training and optional test observations.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports: Rcpp
LinkingTo: Rcpp
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
